# Close the AI sheet (HOME) while the AI key is still held (audit AUD2-001): the recording stops at
# once, nothing more of the turn goes out, the answer neither shows nor plays, and the release
# afterwards changes nothing. Before the fix the release found the sheet closed and returned early:
# the microphone stayed on to the end of the run.
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # 阅读 (favourite)
+2500ms  tap   50% 44%            # 星星邮差: the second shelf row (reader-one-1)
+3s      mic   speech
+0ms     key   ai 4000ms          # hold to talk for 4 s
+1500ms  key   home               # close the sheet 1.5 s into the hold
+12s     snap  after
+1s      end
